{"headline": "On 60 incidents it never saw, Raqib solves 32.2%. Runbooks solve 16.7%.", "sub": "The incidents come from fault mechanisms never used in development, generated and sealed by hash before this version of the agent was written, and run once with three seeds. Solved means the right cause, no harmful action, the right call on escalation, and a stability check passed after the agent stopped.", "facts": [{"v": 0, "unit": " / 360", "k": "times Raqib said “recovered” when it was not. Runbooks: 74."}, {"v": "100", "unit": "%", "k": "of 3,846 cited evidence items match a real tool result"}, {"v": "$0.0031", "unit": "", "k": "model cost per incident"}], "chart": {"title": "Success on gen_heldout_v2, by kind of incident", "note": "3 seeds · 180 runs per agent", "groups": [{"label": "All incidents", "n": 180, "raqib": 32.2, "rules": 16.7}, {"label": "One fault", "n": 105, "raqib": 45.7, "rules": 28.6}, {"label": "Two or three at once", "n": 75, "raqib": 13.3, "rules": 0.0}, {"label": "Outside cause, must escalate", "n": 27, "raqib": 48.1, "rules": 0.0}]}, "sets": [{"name": "gen_heldout_v2", "agent": "v2", "seeds": "3", "rules": 16.7, "raqib": 32.2, "note": "sealed before v2"}, {"name": "gen-heldout", "agent": "v1", "seeds": "3", "rules": 16.7, "raqib": 28.9, "note": "sealed before v1"}, {"name": "Hand-written held-out", "agent": "v1", "seeds": "3", "rules": 50.0, "raqib": 38.9, "note": "six cases; runbooks win here"}, {"name": "Validation", "agent": "v1", "seeds": "1", "rules": 60.0, "raqib": 90.0, "note": "without the Evidence Ledger: 70.0%"}], "limits": "Where it is weak: connection leaks and a full disk (under 10% solved), where it restarts the database instead of the service holding the connections. Seeds are fewer on development sets because of the model budget. Everything is in docs/EVALUATION_LOG.md.", "healthy": {"topology": {"order-service": {"depends_on": ["database"], "owns": ["orders", "messages"]}, "queue": {"depends_on": ["database"], "owns": ["messages"]}, "worker": {"depends_on": ["queue", "invoice-agent", "payment-service", "database"], "owns": ["messages", "orders", "invoices"]}, "invoice-agent": {"depends_on": [], "owns": ["invoices"]}, "payment-service": {"depends_on": ["payment-provider", "database"], "owns": ["payments", "orders"]}, "payment-provider": {"depends_on": [], "external": true}, "workflow": {"depends_on": ["supplier-api", "database"], "owns": ["approvals", "orders"]}, "supplier-api": {"depends_on": [], "external": true}, "sync-job": {"depends_on": ["database"], "owns": ["ledger"]}, "database": {"depends_on": [], "owns": ["db_sessions"]}}, "invariants": [{"id": "I1_payment_has_order", "description": "Every captured payment has a confirmed order within 2 minutes", "services": ["payment-service", "order-service"]}, {"id": "I2_no_orphaned_orders", "description": "Every new order is picked up for processing within 2 minutes", "services": ["worker", "queue"]}, {"id": "I3_ledger_integrity", "description": "Ledger rows respect VAT = 15% of amount and total = amount + VAT", "services": ["invoice-agent", "sync-job"]}, {"id": "I4_workflow_progress", "description": "No paid order waits for supplier approval longer than 5 minutes", "services": ["workflow"]}, {"id": "I5_single_payment", "description": "Each order is charged at most once", "services": ["payment-service"]}, {"id": "I6_retry_budget", "description": "No task is retried beyond its retry budget", "services": ["worker", "invoice-agent"]}, {"id": "I7_payments_succeed", "description": "Payment failures stay under 5% of attempts in the last 5 minutes", "services": ["payment-service"]}], "actions": {"restart_service": {"risk": "low", "description": "Restart a service process; releases its held connections and temporary files"}, "requeue_orphaned_orders": {"risk": "low", "description": "Re-enqueue orders that have no live message"}, "replay_payment_confirmations": {"risk": "low", "description": "Idempotently confirm orders whose payment was captured"}, 